{"id":"proceso","lemma":"proceso","pos":"noun","rank":1230,"glosses":["process","lawsuit","trial"],"ipa":"/pɾoˈθeso/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"procesos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-proceso.wav","examples":[{"text":"El proceso fue rápido.","en":"The process was quick.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301857"},{"text":"Le expliqué el proceso.","en":"I explained the process to him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645477"},{"text":"Es un proceso muy simple.","en":"It's a very simple process.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78014"},{"text":"El proceso está totalmente robotizado.","en":"The process is totally automated."},{"text":"La respiración es un proceso corporal involuntario.","en":"Breathing is an involuntary bodily process."}]}